{"question_id": "L06", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"refusal_category\": null,\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"每枚飞弹对其目标造成 1d4 + 1 点力场伤害。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:spell:magic-missile\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 82, "prompt_tokens": 1129, "total_tokens": 1211}, "yuan": 0.00029140000000000004, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "L07", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"在1级选择生命领域时，牧师获得重甲熟练。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:subclass:life-domain\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"从1级开始，牧师的“生命门徒”特性生效，每当你使用一个1环或更高环位的法术恢复某个生物的生命值时，该生物还会额外恢复 `2 + 法术环阶` 点生命值。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:subclass:life-domain\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 145, "prompt_tokens": 5179, "total_tokens": 5324}, "yuan": 0.0011518, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "L08", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"refusal_category\": null,\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"目盲生物无法看见，并且任何需要视觉的属性检定都会自动失败。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:condition:blinded\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"针对该生物的攻击检定具有优势，而该生物的攻击检定具有劣势。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:condition:blinded\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 122, "prompt_tokens": 1564, "total_tokens": 1686}, "yuan": 0.00041040000000000006, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "L10", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"refusal_category\": null,\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"成年红龙的挑战等级是17。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:monster:adult-red-dragon\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "prompt_tokens": 4851, "total_tokens": 4922}, "yuan": 0.001027, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M01", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"当一个你能看见的敌对生物移动离开你的触及范围时，你可以对它进行一次借机攻击。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:rule:combat\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"若你在移动中离开了一个敌对生物的触及范围，就会引发借机攻击。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:rule:combat\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 118, "prompt_tokens": 2587, "total_tokens": 2705}, "yuan": 0.0006117999999999999, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M03", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"拥有半掩护的目标，其 AC 与敏捷豁免获得 +2 加值。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:rule:combat\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"拥有四分之三掩护的目标，其 AC 与敏捷豁免获得 +5 加值。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:rule:combat\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 117, "prompt_tokens": 2656, "total_tokens": 2773}, "yuan": 0.0006248000000000001, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M05", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"短休结束时，角色可以花费生命骰来恢复生命值。每花费一枚生命骰，玩家便掷出该骰，并加入角色的体质调整值，恢复等于总数的生命值（最低为 0）[srd51:rule:adventuring]。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:rule:adventuring\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"吟游诗人在短休期间若通过花费生命骰恢复生命值，其休憩之歌特性可使这些生物额外恢复一定点数的生命值（初始为 1d6，随等级提高而增加）[srd51:class:bard]。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:class:bard\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"德鲁伊在短休期间可以通过自然恢复特性，选择恢复若干已消耗的法术位，其总等级不得超过德鲁伊等级的一半（向上取整），且不能有 6 环或更高环位 [srd51:subclass:circle-of-the-land]。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:subclass:circle-of-the-land\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"法师在短休期间可以通过奥术恢复特性，选择恢复若干已消耗的法术位，其总等级不得超过法师等级的一半（向上取整），且不能有 6 环或更高环位 [srd51:class:wizard]。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:class:wizard\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 363, "prompt_tokens": 7810, "total_tokens": 8173}, "yuan": 0.0018524000000000001, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M06", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"掷一个 d20。若结果为 10 或更高，则成功；否则失败。单次成功或失败本身不会立刻产生影响。当你累积第三次成功时，你会变为稳定状态。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:rule:combat\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 91, "prompt_tokens": 3689, "total_tokens": 3780}, "yuan": 0.0008106, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
{"question_id": "M08", "model_name": "qwen3.7-flash-2026-07-15", "retry": false, "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"answer\",\n  \"sentences\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"每回合一次，当你以一次攻击命中一个生物，且你的该次攻击检定具有优势时，可以对该生物额外造成偷袭伤害。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:class:rogue\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"该攻击必须使用灵巧武器或远程武器。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:class:rogue\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"如果目标 5 尺内有另一个它的敌人，且该敌人未失能，并且你此次攻击检定没有劣势，那么即使你没有优势，也可以造成偷袭伤害。\",\n      \"entry_id\": \"srd51:class:rogue\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 184, "prompt_tokens": 2620, "total_tokens": 2804}, "yuan": 0.0006712, "peak": true, "structure_ok": true, "citation_scope_ok": true, "numbers_ok": true, "version_ok": true, "category_ok": true, "false_refusal": false, "require_dm_ok": true, "api_error": false}
